---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import service1 from "../../assets/images/service1.png";
import service2 from "../../assets/images/service2.png";
import arrow from "../../assets/icons/arrow.svg";
---

<section class="services-details" id="services-details">
  <div class="container services">
    <div class="service">
      <div class="img"><Image src={service1} alt="" /></div>
      <div class="content">
        <h3>Licensed Professional Counselor</h3>
        <p>
          As a Licensed Professional Counselor, I provide individual therapy grounded in evidence-based, client-centered
          approaches. My practice draws on Solution-Focused Therapy, Person-Centered Therapy, Motivational Interviewing,
          and Rational Emotive Behaviour Therapy (REBT) to help clients identify their strengths, build motivation for
          change, and develop practical strategies for reaching their goals. I specialize in working with young adults
          and teenagers, while maintaining competency across a variety of demographics and populations. Sessions are
          collaborative and tailored to each individual's needs, values, and pace.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>This service is private pay (out of pocket). A sliding scale is available based on financial need.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="service service2">
      <div class="content">
        <h3>CMPC Mentorship</h3>
        <p>
          I offer mentorship for students pursuing their Certified Mental Performance Consultant (CMPC) credential, as
          well as recent graduates who still need to complete their mentorship hours. This service provides guidance,
          supervision, and practical support to help mentees develop their consulting skills and meet certification
          requirements. Both individual and group mentorship formats are available, offering flexibility to fit
          different learning styles and schedules.
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>This service is private pay (out of pocket). A sliding scale is available based on financial need.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="img"><Image src={service2} alt="" /></div>
    </div>

    <div class="services-btn">
      <a href="" class="btn">SCHEDULE YOUR SESSION <Image src={arrow} alt="" /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-details {
    background: var(--blue-span2);
    & .services {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 40px;
      & .service {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 40px;
        padding: 40px;
        background: var(--l-blue2);
        align-items: center;
        & h3 {
          font: var(--font-h3);
          color: var(--white);
          padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        & p {
          font: var(--font-p1);
          color: var(--white);
        }
      }
      & .service2 {
        background: var(--bg-color);
      }
      & .services-btn {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
      }
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 440px) {
    .services-details {
      & .services {
        & .service {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }
    }
  }
</style>
